Adapted third-party code
------------------------

The opponent-MMR leaderboard feature (Game/BgMmr.cs, Ui/LeaderboardOverlay.cs)
was inspired by and adapts portions of HDT-BGMMRPlugin — specifically the
leaderboard-overlay reference geometry/layout and the opponent-tracking
approach — subsequently modified and extended with additional features and an
independent data source (hsbg.cards). HDT-BGMMRPlugin itself credits MMRadar
(https://github.com/lowerman/MMRadar_HDT_BG, (c) 2026 lowerman, MIT License)
for portions of its logic.

